// The one named after the engine. Dusk over the sea, night blue underneath, teal where the light still is, and the
// sun gold for the accent. Dark enough for a long session and not grey. The one Hex comes up in, so the comments, the
// line numbers and the edges of things are a shade lighter than the rest of the themes have them, a laptop in the sun
// has to read them too.

